<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings--AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings--AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American</p>
<p>Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		 Pct Change	 Week Ending:</p>
<p>    -		From Year Ago  05/31/97   06/01/96</p>
<p> Grain		     7.9	 19,394     17,970</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products   3.6	  9,142	8,826</p>
<p> Other Farm Products   7.4	  1,599	1,489</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	   6.8	 23,692     22,182</p>
